<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman re-initiates TF1.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman re-initiates TF1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs re-initiated coverage of Tilivision Frangaise 1 (TF1), France's biggest private television station, with a &quot;market performer&quot; rating, the investment bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>Further details were not imediately available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
